          t: 498.52465259999985
          r: 504.00338739999967
          b: 457.2457743929202
          coord_origin: COORD_ORIGIN_BOTTOMLEFT
        }
        charspan {
          end: 371
        }
      }
      orig: "Docling provides an easy code interface to convert PDF documents from file system, URLs or binary streams, and retrieve the output in either JSON or Markdown format. For convenience, separate methods are offered to convert single documents or batches of documents. A basic usage example is illustrated below. Further examples are available in the Doclign code repository."
      text: "Docling provides an easy code interface to convert PDF documents from file system, URLs or binary streams, and retrieve the output in either JSON or Markdown format. For convenience, separate methods are offered to convert single documents or batches of documents. A basic usage example is illustrated below. Further examples are available in the Doclign code repository."
    }
  }
}
