      orig: "Phase 1: Data selection and preparation. Our inclusion criwhile coverage ensures that all meaningful items on a page can be annotated. We refrained from class labels that are very speci￿c to a document category, such as Abstract in the Scienti￿c Articles category. We also avoided class labels that are tightly linked to the semantics of the text. Labels such as Author and A￿liation, as seen"
      text: "Phase 1: Data selection and preparation. Our inclusion criwhile coverage ensures that all meaningful items on a page can be annotated. We refrained from class labels that are very speci￿c to a document category, such as Abstract in the Scienti￿c Articles category. We also avoided class labels that are tightly linked to the semantics of the text. Labels such as Author and A￿liation, as seen"
